@hypothesi/azure-devops-openapi

The files in dist/openapi are converted from the Azure DevOps REST API specifications in
https://github.com/MicrosoftDocs/vsts-rest-api-specs, as archived by Software Heritage
(see source/SOURCE.md in the repository). The conversion changes the format and the
layout. It does not change the API descriptions that Microsoft wrote.

